1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/fosa/fosa-ch4","children":["FOSA丨04丨架构特性定义"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],"$undefined",["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"架构设计"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"FOSA丨04丨架构特性定义"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本篇通过回答《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》第四章的课后思考题，深入探讨架构特性（Architecture Characteristics）的定义与分类，分析架构特性的三个判定标准、隐性与显性特性的区别，以及操作型、结构型、交叉型特性的具体表现形式，帮助理解如何识别和选择适合系统需求的架构特性。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-07-03T10:35:26.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/07/03"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","2,539"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":["本系列文章通过逐章回答",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":13,"offset":12},"end":{"line":1,"column":52,"offset":51}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":12,"offset":11},"end":{"line":1,"column":102,"offset":101}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》"}],"（下文简称 FOSA）一书中的课后思考题，来深入理解书中的核心概念和理论，从而提升我们的软件架构设计能力。本篇为",["$","u","u-0",{"children":"第四章"}],"内容。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"本章的课后题是："}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What three criteria must an attribute meet to be considered an architecture characteristic?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"一个属性要被认定为架构特性，必须满足哪三个条件？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What is the difference between an implicit characteristic and an explicit one? Provide an example of each."}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"隐性特性和显性特性的区别是什么？请分别举一个例子。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Provide an example of an operational characteristic."}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"提供一个操作特性的例子。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Provide an example of a structural characteristic."}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"提供一个结构特性的例子。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Provide an example of a cross-cutting characteristic."}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"提供一个交叉特性的例子。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-5",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Which architecture characteristic is more important to strive for—availability or performance?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"在架构特性中，更应努力追求的是可用性还是性能？"}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-0",{}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"架构特性定义","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#架构特性定义","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#架构特性定义"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"架构特性定义","position":{"start":{"line":31,"column":4,"offset":804},"end":{"line":31,"column":10,"offset":810}}}]},"children":"架构特性定义"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"一个属性要成为架构特性（Architecture Characteristics），需至少满足 3 个条件："}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-1",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"指定非领域设计考量"}],"：架构特性关注的是应用程序\"如何\"实现需求以及做出某些选择\"为何\"的原因，而不是应用程序\"应该做什么\"的业务需求。例如，性能水平通常不会出现在需求文档中，但却是重要的架构特性。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"影响设计的某个结构方面"}],"：如果一个架构特性需要特殊结构考虑才能成功，那么它就会上升到架构特性的层面。例如，一般的安全性对于几乎所有项目都是必需的，但当需要设计特定的模块、组件或服务来隔离关键安全问题时，安全才成为一个架构特性。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"对应用程序的成功至关重要"}],"：应用程序可以支持大量的架构特性，但并非所有都应该被支持。支持每个架构特性都会增加设计的复杂性，因此，架构师的关键任务是选择最少的、对应用程序成功至关重要或重要的架构特性，而不是尽可能多的。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-1",{"id":"显性--隐性","children":"$L8"}],"\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17"]}]}],"$L18","$L19","$L1a"]}],"$L1b"]}]]}]}]
